Route (app)
┌ ○ /
├ ○ /_not-found
├ ○ /about
├ ○ /blog
├   /blog/[slug]
│ ├ ◐ /blog/[slug]
│ ├ ○ /blog/hello-nextjs
│ └ ○ /blog/routing-basics
├   /docs/[[...slug]]
│ └ ◐ /docs/[[...slug]]
├ ○ /old-page
├ ○ /pricing
└   /shop/[...slug]
  └ ◐ /shop/[...slug]

○  (Static)             prerendered as static content
